---
import { appPath, sitePath, clipitIconPath } from '../lib/urls';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
const pricingUrl = sitePath('pricing');
const howUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}#how-it-works`;
---

<section class="clipit-hero relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950">
  <div class="clipit-hero-glow pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.4) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.4) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 48px 48px;"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 pt-16 sm:px-6 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-24">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 py-1.5 pl-1.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
          <span class="clipit-icon-frame clipit-icon-frame--badge">
            <img src={clipitIconPath} alt="" class="clipit-brand-icon" width="32" height="32" />
          </span>
          AIで作って、AIで更新できるマニュアル・教材管理
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem]">
          作る。直す。教える。<br />
          <span class="text-primary-400">ぜんぶ ClipIt で。</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400 lg:mx-0">
          操作記録・話して作成で手順を作り、<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-300">まとめて修正</strong>で古くならない。
          クリニック・中小企業・先生・個人まで——一度作った資料が、ずっと資産になります。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:justify-start">
          <a
            href={loginUrl}
            class="group inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary-500/25 transition-all hover:bg-primary-400 sm:w-auto"
          >
            無料で始める
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 1 1 1.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 0 1 3 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href={howUrl}
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/15 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-200 transition-all hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white sm:w-auto"
          >
            使い方を見る
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-500">初期費用0円 · 主力プラン 月額2,980円 · 5分で初回作成</p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-slate-500 lg:justify-start">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-primary-400">✓</span> Googleログイン</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-primary-400">✓</span> 閲覧者はログイン不要</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-primary-400">✓</span> 手動マスキング</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:max-w-none">
        <div class="clipit-hero-mock rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80"></span>
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/80"></span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">新患受付の手順 — 記録中</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-800/80 aspect-[16/10]">
              <div class="absolute inset-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-dashed border-slate-600"></div>
              <div class="absolute left-[38%] top-[42%] flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-4 border-red-500 bg-red-500/20 text-sm font-bold text-red-400 shadow-lg shadow-red-500/30">
                1
              </div>
              <p class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 rounded-lg bg-black/50 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200">
                「受付」ボタンをクリックして、新患登録画面を開きます。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-lg bg-primary-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-300">● 記録中</span>
              <span class="rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">ステップ 3</span>
              <span class="ml-auto rounded-lg bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Alt+Shift+S 強制キャプチャ</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 hidden rounded-xl border border-primary-400/30 bg-primary-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-200 backdrop-blur sm:block">
          AIが手順文を自動生成
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .clipit-hero-glow {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -20%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 100% 50%, rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.15), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 30% at 0% 80%, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.12), transparent);
  }
  .clipit-hero-icon {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 40px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35));
    animation: clipit-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .clipit-hero-mock {
    animation: clipit-float 6s ease-in-out infinite 0.4s;
  }
  @keyframes clipit-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  }
</style>
